{% load i18n %}{# L10n: This is an email. Whitespace matters! #}{% blocktrans with addon_name=addon.name author_name=author.user.name domain=DOMAIN %}Hello {{ author_name }},

Great news, you have been invited to become an author of {{ addon_name }} on {{ domain }}. Accepting will let you edit the add-on, and your name may appear in the authors list on the website.

If you would like to accept the invitation, just click the link below:

{{ author_confirmation_link }}

If you were not expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.

We are glad to have you building for Firefox,
The Mozilla Add-ons Team{% endblocktrans %}
